.TH MYSTRCAT 3 "September 2026" "libmyutils 1.0" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrcat \- concatenate two strings
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mystrcat(char *" dest ", const char *" src ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mystrcat()
function appends a copy of the string pointed to by
.I src
to the end of the string pointed to by
.I dest .
The
.I dest
buffer must be large enough to hold the resulting concatenated string.
.SH RETURN VALUE
The
.B mystrcat()
function returns the total length of the resulting string in
.I dest .
.SH AUTHOR
Written by Kanwar Albir Zulfiqar.
